# FitPilot AI

FitPilot AI is a production-oriented fitness planning and progress-analysis application.

The project will create structured workout recommendations, record completed sessions, evaluate adherence and performance, retrieve information from a curated fitness knowledge base, and recommend controlled adjustments for future training.

## Current Status

Project foundation and development environment setup.
